---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Claims" description="Find clear TIRO funeral cover claims guidance and prepare for the next step.">
  <section class="claims-hero section"><div class="container"><figure class="page-learn-testimonial"><div class="page-learn-avatar-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="page-mask-line page-mask-line-left"></span><span class="page-mask-line page-mask-line-right"></span><span class="page-mask-line page-mask-line-top"></span><span class="page-mask-line page-mask-line-bottom"></span><img src="/images/about/claims.png" alt="" /></div><figcaption><p class="eyebrow">Claims support</p><h1>Here when it matters most.</h1><p>When you are ready, TIRO will guide you through the current claims process with care and clarity.</p></figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="claims-process section" id="claim-guide"><div class="container"><div class="claims-desk"><header class="claims-desk-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Claims preparation desk</p><h2>Keep the important things within reach.</h2><p>Tick off what you have before you contact TIRO. We’ll confirm the current requirements and the approved way to submit your claim.</p></header><aside class="claims-callout"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p>When you’re ready</p><strong>Contact TIRO first.</strong><small>We’ll guide you through the requirements for your policy and give you a claim reference to keep.</small><details><summary>Why preparation helps <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Complete and current documents can make the conversation clearer and reduce avoidable delays. Do not send sensitive documents through an unverified channel.</p></details></aside><section class="document-vault" aria-labelledby="document-vault-heading"><div class="vault-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your document vault</p><h3 id="document-vault-heading">What you may need</h3></div><output class="readiness" for="policy-certificate receipt-book death-certificate deceased-id claimant-id banking-details bi1663"><strong data-ready-count>0</strong><span>of 7 ready</span></output></div><div class="document-grid"><label class="document-item"><input id="policy-certificate" type="checkbox" /><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Policy certificate</strong><small>Original policy document.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></label><label class="document-item"><input id="receipt-book" type="checkbox" /><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Up-to-date receipt book</strong><small>Current payment records.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></label><label class="document-item"><input id="death-certificate" type="checkbox" /><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Death certificate</strong><small>Valid official certificate.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></label><label class="document-item"><input id="deceased-id" type="checkbox" /><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>ID: deceased</strong><small>Policyholder identity.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></label><label class="document-item"><input id="claimant-id" type="checkbox" /><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>ID: claimant</strong><small>Person submitting the claim.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></label><label class="document-item"><input id="banking-details" type="checkbox" /><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Banking details</strong><small>For the correct payout account.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></label><label class="document-item document-item-wide"><input id="bi1663" type="checkbox" /><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>BI 1663 document</strong><small>Four pages, issued by the mortuary.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></label></div><p class="vault-note">Document requirements can vary by policy. TIRO will confirm the final list with you.</p></section></div></div></section><style>
  .claims-hero { background: var(--tiro-navy); color: white; }.claims-hero > .container { max-width: 900px; }.claims-hero .eyebrow { color: white; }.claims-hero h1 { margin: 12px 0 16px; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.7rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.055em; }.claims-hero p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 650px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .claims-process { margin-top: -165px; padding-top: 50px; overflow: hidden; background: white; }.claims-desk { display: grid; gap: 18px; }.claims-desk-heading { padding: clamp(8px, 1vw, 18px) 0 clamp(12px, 2vw, 26px); }.claims-desk-heading h2 { max-width: 700px; margin: 10px 0 14px; color: var(--tiro-navy); font-size: clamp(2.45rem, 5.4vw, 4.8rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.065em; }.claims-desk-heading > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 690px; margin: 0; font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .claims-callout { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 8px; align-content: start; min-height: 286px; padding: 30px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 24px; background: linear-gradient(140deg, #f52a3d, #bd0b20); color: white; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px #b9081c2e; }.claims-callout::after { content: ''; position: absolute; right: -68px; bottom: -76px; width: 230px; height: 230px; border: 1px solid #ffffff64; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 35px #ffffff12, 0 0 0 70px #ffffff0d; }.callout-icon { display: grid; width: 42px; height: 42px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #ffffff90; border-radius: 12px; background: #ffffff18; font-size: 1.15rem; }.claims-callout > p { margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }.claims-callout > strong { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.35rem); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.045em; }.claims-callout > small { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 32ch; color: #fff0f1; font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.45; }.claims-callout details { position: relative; z-index: 1; margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px solid #ffffff55; padding-top: 15px; }.claims-callout summary { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }.claims-callout summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }.claims-callout summary span { font-size: 1.15rem; transition: transform 180ms ease; }.claims-callout details[open] summary span { transform: rotate(45deg); }.claims-callout details p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #fff0f1; font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .document-vault { padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); border-radius: 24px; background: var(--tiro-navy); box-shadow: 0 24px 48px #071a3d26; color: white; }.vault-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 28px; }.vault-heading .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #7cb1ff; }.vault-heading h3 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3.5vw, 2.7rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.045em; }.readiness { display: grid; min-width: 74px; place-items: center; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #ffffff4d; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff0e; }.readiness strong { font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1; }.readiness span { margin-top: 3px; color: #bcd5ff; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .document-grid { display: grid; gap: 9px; }.document-item { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr 22px; align-items: center; gap: 11px; min-height: 70px; padding: 13px; border: 1px solid #ffffff26; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff08; color: white; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease; }.document-item:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: #ffffff68; background: #ffffff12; }.document-item input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; }.document-icon { position: relative; width: 23px; height: 28px; border: 1.5px solid #bcd5ff; border-radius: 4px; }.document-icon::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 6px; left: 5px; width: 11px; height: 1px; background: #bcd5ff; box-shadow: 0 5px #bcd5ff, 0 10px #bcd5ff; }.document-item > span:nth-child(3) { display: grid; gap: 2px; }.document-item strong { font-size: .92rem; }.document-item small { color: #bcd5ff; font-size: .75rem; }.document-item b { display: grid; width: 20px; height: 20px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #bcd5ff75; border-radius: 50%; color: transparent; font-size: .75rem; transition: color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease; }.document-item:has(input:checked) { border-color: #78aaff; background: #1763d82b; }.document-item:has(input:checked) b { background: #78aaff; color: var(--tiro-navy); border-color: #78aaff; }.document-item:has(input:checked) .document-icon { border-color: #fff; }.vault-note { margin: 18px 0 0; color: #bcd5ff; font-size: .8rem; }
  @media (min-width: 720px) { .claims-desk { grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, .58fr) minmax(0, 1.42fr); align-items: stretch; }.claims-desk-heading { grid-column: 1 / -1; }.claims-callout { min-height: 100%; }.document-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }.document-item-wide { grid-column: span 2; } } @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .document-item, .claims-callout summary span { transition: none; } }
</style>
<style>
  .claims-hero { background: white; color: var(--tiro-navy); }
  .page-learn-testimonial { width: min(100%, 512px); margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .page-learn-avatar-wrap { position: relative; width: 96px; height: 96px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .page-learn-avatar-wrap img { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; mask-image: none; }
  .page-mask-line { position: absolute; z-index: 0; background: #071a3d33; }
  .page-mask-line-left, .page-mask-line-right { top: -85%; bottom: -85%; width: 1px; mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, black 20%, black 80%, transparent); }
  .page-mask-line-left { left: 0; }.page-mask-line-right { right: 0; }
  .page-mask-line-top, .page-mask-line-bottom { left: 0; width: 576px; height: 1px; mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 20%, black 80%, transparent); }
  .page-mask-line-top { top: 0; }.page-mask-line-bottom { bottom: 0; }
  .page-learn-avatar-wrap::before, .page-learn-avatar-wrap::after { position: absolute; z-index: 0; left: -92px; width: 92px; height: 1px; content: ''; background: #071a3d33; mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black); }
  .page-learn-avatar-wrap::before { top: 0; }.page-learn-avatar-wrap::after { bottom: 0; }
  .page-learn-testimonial figcaption { padding: 32px; text-align: center; }.page-learn-testimonial .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--tiro-blue); }
  .claims-hero .page-learn-testimonial h1 { margin: 0; color: var(--tiro-navy); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.7rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .claims-hero .page-learn-testimonial figcaption > p:last-child { max-width: none; margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--tiro-grey); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  @media (min-width: 720px) { .page-learn-testimonial { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; align-items: center; transform: translate(-370px, -30px); }.page-learn-avatar-wrap { width: 128px; height: 128px; }.page-learn-testimonial figcaption { padding: 24px; text-align: left; } }
</style>
<style is:global>.claims-talk { display: inline-flex; width: fit-content; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid #ffffffa8; border-radius: 999px; background: white; color: var(--tiro-red); box-shadow: 0 8px 18px #8f07171f; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 850; line-height: 1; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, background 180ms ease; }.claims-talk span { color: var(--tiro-red); font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: .7; }.claims-talk:hover { background: #fff5f6; box-shadow: 0 12px 24px #8f071730; transform: translateY(-2px); }</style>
<script>document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('.claims-callout details').forEach((details) => { details.open = true; }); const callout = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.claims-callout'); if (callout && !callout.querySelector('.claims-talk')) { const talk = document.createElement('a'); talk.className = 'claims-talk'; talk.href = '/branches/'; talk.innerHTML = 'Talk to TIRO <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>'; callout.append(talk); }</script>
</SiteLayout>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.document-vault').forEach((vault) => { const inputs = Array.from(vault.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[type=checkbox]')); const output = vault.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-ready-count]'); const update = () => { if (output) output.textContent = String(inputs.filter((input) => input.checked).length); }; inputs.forEach((input) => input.addEventListener('change', update)); update(); });
</script>
